<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MBO at Ampaglas unit of Murray &amp; Roberts.</title>
<headline>MBO at Ampaglas unit of Murray &amp; Roberts.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A management consortium has acquired the buisness of the Ampaglas division of Abertech Industries (Pty) Ltd, a wholly-owned unit of Murray and Roberts Engineering Holdings Ltd, adviser Standard Merchant and Corporate Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Ampaglas is the leading manufacturer of extruded plastic sheeting in South Africa. No financial details were given.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
